<title>SWEDEN: Swedish debt office sets new 10-yr benchmark loan.</title>
<headline>Swedish debt office sets new 10-yr benchmark loan.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swedish National Debt Office (NDO) said on Wednesday it would open a new 10-year benchmark loan, series 1038.</p>
<p>It said it would make an offer to exchange the current three-year 1028 series loan for the new 10-year 1038 series.</p>
</text>
